{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "4cfc096c00f3cd2a43ebdcc6b733b55503de3dbf467c8e2c08f84558c3e51a63", "ja": "ほら、体を動かすと気持ちよくならない？\n思いっきり走ったり、飛んだりして！", "zh": "你看，活动一下身体不是很舒服吗？\n尽情地跑啊、跳啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "50c9d0c443b48fd8169d24a7edb99c4d034a83640162a19b33d4ef2b850a5d3f", "ja": "いっぱい汗をかいたら、気分もスッキリするし。\nうう～っ、話してたら動きたくなってきた～！", "zh": "流了好多汗之后，心情也会变得格外舒畅。\n唔唔～！越说越想动起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "992f289d9f2378cebd2df56d589e2e5120ed9d15066a9aabaa61b8bd341ce877", "ja": "えへ♪　海美ちゃんの話を聞いてたら、私も！\n全力ダッシュ～でリフレッシュ～♪", "zh": "诶嘿♪ 听海美聊着聊着，我也想来！  \n全力冲刺——放松一下——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "bc8c182e0fdd4373471cab628ee012c2f354b12f8f265433f764269d3ed045e4", "ja": "でも、ロコはアクティビティの後はフラフラで。\n何もできなくなっちゃいますから……。", "zh": "不过，ROCO活动后会累得浑身发软，什么都做不了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "cfe40be6aecb36835c32df043bddda32fa3739b4998a1c8fb9ac130971918433", "ja": "そ、そっか、体力がないと運動が好きになれないんだ。\nじゃあ、体力つけたら運動も好きになれるかも！", "zh": "啊、啊，是这样啊，没有体力就没法喜欢上运动呢。那要是增强体力，说不定也能喜欢上运动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "38a0e4740fec5af7d3ca4956f7cde0a7b641764125dde406aeff6832fb4f7d9b", "ja": "あれ？　でも体力をつけるには運動しなくちゃいけない\nし、でも運動は好きじゃないし……、どうしよう！？", "zh": "咦？但要增强体力就必须运动，\n可又不喜欢运动……该怎么办才好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c81cba90a4b52ede53f614db968b312de9ea0c6b9880781d1d7409af1ae8203f", "ja": "海美は……あ、いたいた！\nって、どうしたんだ？　みんなで難しい顔して？", "zh": "海美……啊，在这里！\n嗯，怎么了？大家为什么都一脸严肃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "af2f01ac60eb917651bdb17658efab8370ac7f75f62c64c03038ddb799656e90", "ja": "{$P$}、ナイスタイミーング♪\n一緒に考えて！　運動を好きになるための運動！", "zh": "{$P$}，来得正是时候♪  \n一起想想吧！让人喜欢上运动的运动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1f0a528a2b46bd0c8de814458ad3fa0c8715b4fade95e8c065b87dbe29db4dff", "ja": "……なんか、ややこしそうな話なんだな。\nどうしてそんな話に？", "zh": "……听上去事情挺复杂的呢。\n怎么会聊到这个的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "76e90696062023c6ca5cce2d121e88ffdc59e63c1047d4571e50852235c4735a", "ja": "じつは、もうすぐロコの学校で\n体育祭があるんですけど……。", "zh": "其实，再过不久ROCO的学校就要举办体育祭了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1011_p", "source_sha256": "16b65e472dbfd988aff31f5bcd0e710ef64cb5625dc3e6120d1e89a25cd03c79", "ja": "なるほど。ロコが海美みたいに、スポーツを楽しめる\nようになる方法か……。確かにナイスタイミングだな！", "zh": "原来如此。让ROCO像海美一样享受运动的方法吗……确实是个好时机啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "be99221d36ef78842f00bbafb859b28f82350d07a9a22ef26cbccaa2eeaa6559", "ja": "はれっ、なにかあるんですか！？　すごーい！\nさすが{$P$}さんです！", "zh": "咦，有什么吗！？好厉害！\n不愧是{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5e14085a9f51c538d14832fc30bacd8a6570af3248a81579e03e681e40c9f722", "ja": "すごくはないけど、ただ……ほら。\nこの曲がヒントになりそうだと思って。", "zh": "虽然没那么夸张，只是……你看。\n我觉得这首歌或许能成为提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "e639408d660885a2d0d7650aec21e3c1573e66dfa291282dce53d3ae224bcbd8", "ja": "この曲？", "zh": "这首歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "e639408d660885a2d0d7650aec21e3c1573e66dfa291282dce53d3ae224bcbd8", "ja": "この曲？", "zh": "这首歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "e639408d660885a2d0d7650aec21e3c1573e66dfa291282dce53d3ae224bcbd8", "ja": "この曲？", "zh": "这首歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "cb6ce8ebdc4bef45d7cdec8ae4b92fdc88a26cadce97e391988c62f2e9a84b3c", "ja": "わあ～、すごい元気になりそうな曲だねっ！\nなんか、体が勝手に動いちゃう～！", "zh": "哇～，感觉听了这首歌就会变得精神十足呢！\n身体好像会不由自主地动起来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "d159124487882963cda83e980bbe4cb2893419463fad00c2f8da11a405151575", "ja": "元気もやる気も、ぐんぐんわいてくる気がしますっ！\nそれに、とにかく楽しいかも！", "zh": "感觉精力和干劲都在不断涌出来呢！\n而且，感觉特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "7362ce111bfe097693a5e6d3246482e4794ffc0e2a0d6854660636df4201ec78", "ja": "ふむふむ。曲そのものがエクササイズなんですね！\nとってもユニークだって思います！", "zh": "嗯嗯。原来歌曲本身就是锻炼呢！\n我觉得真的非常独特！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7a54cbf3259248fb93c42ea18d9a398d01fef523c87ebaa304ab604ed0197e07", "ja": "そうなんだ。次の公演では、海美にこの曲を\n歌ってもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "是这样。下一场公演，我想让海美唱这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "14b8cc84b841f69e33585f0994cfcfbcb6130ac1f9b67a3d6502be9526d18894", "ja": "えっ、そうだったの？　私の曲なんだ！？\nやった～！　ねえねえ、もう1回聴かせて！", "zh": "咦，原来是这样啊？这是我的歌！？  \n太好了～！呐呐，再让我听1遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "d7ed284bccd28662b477d42611a5e7b31d7d46fedbf40b4b34f6281e9dc7fc3c", "ja": "{$P$}、この曲歌ってみたい！\n会場のみんなと一緒に、歌って踊ってみたい！", "zh": "{$P$}，我想试着唱唱这首歌！\n我想和现场的大家一起唱歌跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1025_p", "source_sha256": "513df83d6fda3897809e5363dd1535d5e3e93f716f4c29a3a19462783e40d7bd", "ja": "わかったよ。\nそれじゃ、すぐレッスンの日程を組んでみよう。", "zh": "我知道了。\n那我现在就去安排练习的日程吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "1197f12bcc67569155af5cd667b8b2d0b9620ef42d5133c2084fd9183ece2e3f", "ja": "そうだ！　ロコロコも公演に出てみない？\nこの曲で一緒に踊ったら、体力もつきそう！", "zh": "对了！要不要让ROCOROCO也参加演出？\n一起跳这首歌的话，体力好像也能得到锻炼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "83b446c47557d05f5664e475ca4c451a5fa4d30dcaed47352ae02c1e3e949258", "ja": "そ、そうですね！　フラフラにもなりそうですけど……\nエキサイティングですし、ロコもジョインしたいです！", "zh": "是、是啊！虽然感觉也会累得晕乎乎的……不过很刺激，我也想加入ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "8bbf82dab030e4d00aae75ab2375bf8c57ab39ea77ae9d3f981c77f4910f06ab", "ja": "私も私も！　ここでみんなと一緒に聴いてるだけで、\nすっごく楽しくなっちゃいました！", "zh": "我也是我也是！光是在这里和大家一起听，就已经变得超级开心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0786069c4e4ddd45396d8941dbec5ca4ab77b9e98db465b6d2354b768cde2fa6", "ja": "わかった！　二人ともよろしくな。\nじゃあ、みんなのスケジュールでレッスン日程を……。", "zh": "知道了！你们两个也请多关照。\n那么，就按照大家的日程来安排课程时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e554f892cfa58f5f31205e5098c74a211e1cbe58591f0e86de336eddf2dcbf75", "ja": "あれ？　この3人だと、あんまり予定が合わないな。\n調整はしてみるけど……。", "zh": "奇怪？要是这3个人的话，日程不太凑得齐啊。\n我先试着调整一下看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "dd78a094208efa571cb9f9696a99dc5d855be32e3a942789b9ff31bde5fd9638", "ja": "そうなの？　うーん、1人ずつでも、\nレッスンはできるけど……。", "zh": "这样啊？嗯——就算每组1人，也可以上课，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "0e536a95c8fcb9644d2c68fc68d1b0986043ed53e58a86baafc2ed8ebef4198a", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。1日くらいなら、\nみんなのスケジュール合わせられる？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。如果是1天左右，能把大家的日程安排到一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9c9d0b48c29cc1d13ab2e815c67eb36c18f05cfc6126af9f9c4432d12ac4fea4", "ja": "1日？　それなら大丈夫だと思うな。\nずらせる予定もいくつかあるから。", "zh": "1天？那我觉得没问题。\n也有几个可以调整的日程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "d7d699cc129bb0a118096804d3ef67a6eb9a29a158cce5e7733a197183488c97", "ja": "じゃあ、その日はみんなで劇場でお泊り会しない？\n1日だけでも、一緒に特訓するの！", "zh": "那么，那天大家一起在剧场举办留宿会怎么样？\n哪怕只有1天，也要一起特训！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "18bc79c0dd7d81d2bf8003594b682d4ca3e3be254c3357384469b209ff2932f9", "ja": "なるほど……グッドアイデアだと思いますよ！\nウミのコーチング、楽しみです♪", "zh": "原来如此……我觉得这是个好主意！\n我很期待海美的指导哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "04428a893bb370e70426b8239c665d053d6a94ee0833cd5771fc59091c3c27cb", "ja": "私も素敵だと思います！\nえへへ、特訓なのに楽しそう♪", "zh": "我也觉得很棒！嘿嘿，明明是特训，却感觉好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_089_1038_p", "source_sha256": "f56ef8a7c6eaf2b6b97baa0c7c2b202c2b5b71e33cca2d8138c1081074e938c8", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ、そっちも準備しておくから、\nみんなは親御さんに許可をもらっておくこと！", "zh": "知道了。那我也去准备起来，\n大家一定要先取得家长的同意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
